  'tour.welcome.t': 'Welcome to PHC Pulse',
  'tour.welcome.b': 'This tour shows you every part of the platform in about 3 minutes. Use **Next** and **Back** (or the arrow keys), and press the speaker to hear each step read aloud.',
  'tour.nav.t': 'The main menu',
  'tour.nav.b': 'Pages for **officers** are at the top, tools for **health workers** in the middle, and how the platform works at the bottom.',
  'tour.role.t': 'Whose view is this?',
  'tour.role.b': 'Each officer sees only their own area. In this demo you can switch role to see what a national, state, district or PHC officer sees.',
  'tour.display.t': 'Language and text size',
  'tour.display.b': 'Change the language or make the text bigger at any time. Your choice is remembered on this device.',
  'tour.kpis.t': 'Today at a glance',
  'tour.kpis.b': 'How many PHCs reported today, medicines about to run out, outbreak alerts, and transfers waiting for your approval.',
  'tour.map.t': 'The PHC map',
  'tour.map.b': '**Green** is stable, **amber** at risk, **red** critical. A dashed circle marks an outbreak cluster. Tap any PHC to open its forecast.',
  'tour.briefing.t': 'Daily AI briefing',
  'tour.briefing.b': 'Pulse writes today\'s priority list for your area, in your language. Press **Generate**, then the speaker to listen.',
  'tour.impact.t': 'What today\'s plan achieves',
  'tour.impact.b': 'Stock-out days prevented, patients covered and money saved if the recommended transfers are made.',
  'tour.ask.t': 'Ask Pulse',
  'tour.ask.b': 'Ask anything in plain words, in any Indian language. Pulse looks up the live data itself and can propose a transfer; you confirm it with one tap.',
  'tour.stock.t': 'Stock early warning',
  'tour.stock.b': 'Each box shows how many days a medicine will last at a PHC. **Red** means it will run out before the next supply arrives.',
  'tour.warnings.t': 'What to act on first',
  'tour.warnings.b': 'The most urgent medicines come first, with the expected run-out date and the chance of a stock-out.',
  'tour.redis.t': 'Move medicines, not patients',
  'tour.redis.b': 'Pulse suggests moving surplus stock from a nearby PHC at the lowest transport cost. An officer on the **donor side** approves it with one tap.',
  'tour.tracker.t': 'Track every transfer',
  'tour.tracker.b': 'Follow each transfer from approved to dispatched to delivered. Stock at both PHCs updates automatically.',
  'tour.outbreaks.t': 'Outbreak signals',
  'tour.outbreaks.b': 'When nearby PHCs see more fever, diarrhoea or cough than usual, Pulse raises an early alert and drafts the IDSP report for you.',
  'tour.voiceWho.t': 'Report by voice',
  'tour.voiceWho.b': 'Health workers pick their PHC and language here. They can hear the question read aloud before answering.',
  'tour.voiceSpeak.t': 'Just speak',
  'tour.voiceSpeak.b': 'Tap the microphone and say today\'s stock, beds, staff and patients, or use **Photo** to snap the paper register. Pulse reads the numbers back so you can confirm before saving.',
  'tour.phone.t': 'No smartphone? No problem',
  'tour.phone.b': 'The same daily report can be sent from any basic phone: a USSD menu, an SMS, or a phone call.',
  'tour.model.t': 'How it works',
  'tour.model.b': 'See how accurate the forecasts are, how states share one forecasting model without sharing raw data, a benchmark at the scale of all of India, and exports for HMIS and DHIS2.',
  'tour.done.t': 'You are ready!',
  'tour.done.b': 'That\'s the whole platform. You can restart this tour at any time from the **Help** button.',

